laborations with Aarvik Therapeutics Inc., Shanghai Allist Pharmaceuticals Co., Ltd., Beijing InnoCare Pharma Tech Co., Ltd., Jiangsu Alphamab Biopharmaceuticals Co., Ltd., and Lepu Biopharma Co. Ltd. ArriVent BioPharma, Inc. was incorporated in 2021 and is based in Newtown Square, Pennsylvania."}}